<b>Q4 2026 SLA CREDIT DETERMINATION — CM-88417.</b>
Under the Master Services Agreement (MSA-2023-0441, §14 Service Credits), Northbridge's Q4 performance
breached three availability/response commitments. The resulting credit of <b>USD 42,318.50</b> has been
applied against your account. <b>To convert the credit into a cash refund (instead of carrying it into
Q1 invoices), a bank authorization form must be on file before the quarter close</b> — after close, the
credit auto-applies to Q1 invoices and cannot be refunded for the quarter.
</p>

